{"3899980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Why Me", "steam_appid": 3899980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/6c7638e15f0241746d0857c22d963b23.poster.avif?t=1763748020\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/6c7638e15f0241746d0857c22d963b23.webm?t=1763748020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaotic world of <strong>Why Me</strong>, a 2D platformer where every level is designed to surprise and challenge you. Expect tricky obstacles, mind-bending stunts, and levels that constantly keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/5566246a930d9864c9072a26bcebc683.poster.avif?t=1763748020\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/5566246a930d9864c9072a26bcebc683.webm?t=1763748020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tricky Levels:</strong> Each stage is full of twists, traps, and hidden surprises that test your reflexes and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80 Challenging Levels Across 16 Chapters:</strong> Each chapter introduces new tricks, surprises, and obstacles to keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Gameplay:</strong> Precision, quick thinking, and daring maneuvers are key to mastering the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action:</strong> Levels are designed to keep the adrenaline high and your reflexes sharp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun &amp; Leaderboards:</strong> Race against the clock, master every tricky level, and climb the global leaderboard to see how you stack up against players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/47ba7c239b49a47e1d1d199084b597d4.poster.avif?t=1763748020\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/47ba7c239b49a47e1d1d199084b597d4.webm?t=1763748020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/47ba7c239b49a47e1d1d199084b597d4.mp4?t=1763748020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the chaos, master the tricks, and beat the game on your own terms? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/a7e481e2bf46f4c86eeecf0595c103f7.poster.avif?t=1763748020\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899980/extras/a7e481e2bf46f4c86eeecf0595c103f7.webm?t=1763748020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://s